{"_meta":{"ui":{"resourceUri":"ui://swsd/ticket-stats.html"},"ui/resourceUri":"ui://swsd/ticket-stats.html"},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Summarize scanned tickets created OR last updated in [from, to), defaulting to the last seven days. Alternates created and updated incident-list queries, deduplicates IDs, and shares max_pages across both scans. Totals and breakdowns cover only scanned matching rows, not the tenant backlog or a historical state snapshot. Open excludes Resolved/Closed; unassigned means no individual assignee. Breached uses computeSlaRisk on open tickets at scan time, using due_at and any returned sla_violations (list rows may omit violations). Resolution counts and median elapsed hours use valid resolved_at timestamps in the window only; rows without resolved_at are excluded, never approximated with updated_at. The list API may omit resolved_at, so resolution metrics may be incomplete. An older ticket resolved during the window but last updated afterward can also be absent from these date-filtered scans. Median is null if no valid nonnegative created_at-to-resolved_at durations exist. Assignee/category breakdowns return the top ten.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","properties":{"assigned_to_group":{"description":"Server-side assignment group ID.","exclusiveMinimum":0,"maximum":9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},"from":{"anyOf":[{"format":"date","maxLength":64,"pattern":"^(?:(?:\\d\\d[2468][048]|\\d\\d[13579][26]|\\d\\d0[48]|[02468][048]00|[13579][26]00)-02-29|\\d{4}-(?:(?:0[13578]|1[02])-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\d|3[01])|(?:0[469]|11)-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\d|30)|(?:02)-(?:0[1-9]|1\\d|2[0-8])))$","type":"string"},{"format":"date-time","maxLength":64,"pattern":"^(?:(?:\\d\\d[2468][048]|\\d\\d[13579][26]|\\d\\d0[48]|[02468][048]00|[13579][26]00)-02-29|\\d{4}-(?:(?:0[13578]|1[02])-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\d|3[01])|(?:0[469]|11)-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\d|30